# Business Management System

Read `documentation/PROJECT.md` before changing architecture.

- Prefer simple, readable code. Do not add layers, base classes, or packages unless they solve a real problem.
- Do not implement unrequested business modules.
- Use `AppColors` and `AppTextStyles`. Do not hardcode colors.
- Put the public Supabase URL and anon/publishable key in `lib/config/app_config.dart`. Never add a service-role key to Flutter.
- After finishing work, update `documentation/PROJECT.md` and add `documentation/commands/NNN_short_name.md` for the user command.
